{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0423_1000_p", "source_sha256": "dc25b6ebc0f54fe36c56dfeaae94f328b60dcc4eb02aa34b10de88e63af783cf", "ja": "（今日は亜美のグラビア撮影だ。話題の動物映画との\nコラボで、主演のワンちゃんとの共演だぞ…！）", "zh": "（今天是亚美拍摄写真。是和最近很热门的动物电影合作，要和主演的狗狗一起拍摄……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0423_1001_011ami", "source_sha256": "9275523034798c8da093e5e640e11b6e73eb0e617671a81419940ad6b98616d8", "ja": "むむむ！　この子がサッコンちょー人気のタレント犬、\nポワンくん！？　亜美に手強いライバルの出現だよ！", "zh": "唔唔唔！这孩子就是最近超火的明星犬，\n波汪君！？亚美遇到了强劲的对手呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0423_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a7217e6fceed715d698a5313b37be49f3420e587297b20f4ffcb22069bdd0236", "ja": "ライバルかなぁ。まあ、公開中の映画はハートフルな\n感動作で、主役のポワンくんも評判だよな。", "zh": "算是对手吗？不过，正在上映的电影是一部温情感人的佳作，主演波旺也广受好评啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0423_1003_011ami", "source_sha256": "03274d9f62328a3fd28ec3edc62b5f4a59efd0ecbbcc594b901ba04105d7d740", "ja": "だってタレントってことはアイドルってことっしょ？\nしかも主演なんて犬界のトップスターじゃん！", "zh": "既然说是明星，也就是偶像吧？而且还是主演，那不就是狗界的顶级明星嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0423_1004_011ami", "source_sha256": "17e6f8d457812f45b729073ab060362550266600451f298220e09d8de4247152", "ja": "これは負けられないよ！　ヒトとして！\nヒト界のトップスターをめざすヒトとして！！", "zh": "这可不能输啊！作为人类！作为以人类界顶级明星为目标的人类！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0423_1005_p", "source_sha256": "808ca44ae0a9ff80c631f533b4ac763be17779add42eb518c792876c4a9468ab", "ja": "まあ、対抗意識もいいことだけど、今日の撮影コンセプ\nトは亜美とポワンくんの可愛いツーショット……。", "zh": "不过，有竞争意识也是好事，但今天的拍摄主题，是亚美和ポワン的可爱双人合照……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0423_1006_011ami", "source_sha256": "149bc0bcc21c597063681905dad9c30fa5336103b7d98a17260b0336d6bb9996", "ja": "甘いよ兄ちゃん！　亜美だってアイドルなんだかんね！", "zh": "太天真了吧，哥哥！亜美好歹也是偶像呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0423_1007_011ami", "source_sha256": "60329b9f2ef59ebded897b684ce850520b58d9aa58503a97df3b6cd7d2416c0b", "ja": "それにポワンくんは3歳。亜美のほうが10コも年上\nなんだし、ここは先輩としてのイゲンを見せるとき！", "zh": "而且ポワン才3岁。论年纪，亜美还比他大10岁呢，正是作为前辈展现威严的时候！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0423_1008_011ami", "source_sha256": "5c336fb7660e29f6b22a8a49f8d0eb310880b34d2c11be826159f1a27d14be98", "ja": "ポワンくん！　いざジンジョーに勝負だよー！！", "zh": "波恩！现在堂堂正正地一决胜负吧——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0423_1009_se", "source_sha256": "3bef14374ad729eb4d2c1d73dbfc4474e93793ff45c9c988cec3cda38ff58d3c", "ja": "トテトテトテ……コロン。", "zh": "哒哒哒……咕噜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0423_1010_powankun", "source_sha256": "74e2452c6842a7677b33d3e7f030b2591d90ff0730a859a248dcf448da63b3b6", "ja": "……クゥン？", "zh": "……呜？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0423_1011_011ami", "source_sha256": "103c6e407f5a20d6af4991e4996000183ba49270f10e5b5e4f848da027b76bd4", "ja": "えっ、このボール、亜美にくれるの……？", "zh": "诶，这个球要送给亚美吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0423_1012_011ami", "source_sha256": "9595db33a093e3cfd1de7d3cd2491023267cedab81e1d1046bade90b4700b926", "ja": "うわぁ、ありがとー！　うん！　一緒に遊ぼー！！", "zh": "哇，谢谢你——！嗯！一起玩吧——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0423_1013_p", "source_sha256": "55d4ce269c2a3498ea986e8b42672b0b254dd6d51cf4a4468dc20aae538720f0", "ja": "（さ、さすがトップスター……。\nポワンくん、コンセプトを完璧に理解している！！）", "zh": "（不愧是顶级明星……波万君已经完美理解了这个概念！！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0423_1014_011ami", "source_sha256": "113d9d0406a1171aac1b1130249a79ef8f396e976b580a1d4bfbe59d3bef50c1", "ja": "うわぁ、待て待てー！　今度はこっちから行くよー！\nうりゃ～！　……あははっ！", "zh": "哇，等等等等——！这次换我从这边来——！嘿呀～！……啊哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0423_1015_011ami", "source_sha256": "af1784764ce11c35c7d9740d0a1cb911b0f797d72aa060d2c1eafa001b5a9714", "ja": "……すぅ……すぅ～……\nえへへっ……ポワン……くん……", "zh": "……呼……呼～……\n嘿嘿……波昂……君……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0423_1016_p", "source_sha256": "a7b8d14af85602a9ff90db5048621c580d570a4d7d40b5fa350ad54f9427435a", "ja": "（終始ポワンくんのペースで楽しく遊んだ亜美は、\n遊び疲れて、ポワンくんを抱きしめて眠っている……）", "zh": "（亚美一直按照波旺的节奏开心地玩着，玩累后抱着波旺睡着了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0423_1017_p", "source_sha256": "82eb084eaa596122a58ecd2ea40e3a2efd824be0b3762349430bf6be6c1b0557", "ja": "（なんだかんだでいい画がたくさん撮れたけど、この\nカットも押さえてもらおう。いい写真になりそうだ）", "zh": "（虽然拍到了不少很棒的画面，不过这一幕也得拍下来才行。应该能成为一张好照片。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
